<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips U.S. vacuum cleaner activities end.</title>
<headline>Philips U.S. vacuum cleaner activities end.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Friday it would stop its vacuum cleaner activities in the United States.</p>
